<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-xintangshu" book-id="b-xintangshu-072b" chapter-id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface" source-id="s-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface">
  <p id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">孫<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0001" ref="8uz_r1g_a0f_A">恢</persName>，魏揚州刺史。生濟南太守<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0014" ref="1ec_i30_u8n">恭</persName>。<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0016" ref="1ec_i30_u8n">恭</persName>二子：<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0020" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_A">羨</persName>、<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0022" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_B">憺</persName>。<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0024" ref="1ec_i30_u8n_B">憺</persName>、晉河東太守。生<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0033" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">嶠</persName>，字<persName id="c-xintangshu-072b-wenqiao-surname-preface:sons:m0036" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">太真</persName>，江州刺史、始安忠武公。</p>
</text>
